RIP-IT! Version 1.3 [13-APR-1995] StarWare
RIP-IT! is a set of ARexx scripts that you
can place in your bbstext and/or the ENtry
screens of your system to call menus. You
make your own screens. This program is very
simple and works great! Supports 40 column
and 80 column screens. Everything from ASCII
to RIP! New RIP Screens coming soon!
